    intro:"The Grade 10 parabola is y = ax² + q. <strong>a</strong> controls the shape: a > 0 opens up (smile, minimum), a < 0 opens down (frown, maximum); the bigger |a|, the narrower. <strong>q</strong> shifts it up or down — the turning point is (0; q). The axis of symmetry is x = 0.",
